 "_": "The typography round: heading and body candidates to go with the SMASH typeface (no third face: meta and credits are set in the body face), from Jonas's library (fonts skill, _PUBLIC/FONTS), each with a Google Fonts alternative. library.dir is Category/Family in the library; library.files maps a style (400, 700, 400i …) to a file in it. google.css2 is the css2 family spec; google.css is extra CSS for the alternative (an axis setting). r1 and note are Jonas's round 1 rating and comment; round 2 marks the ones added after it (the geometric direction his top pick, Stolzl Display, opened). Round 1 set aside Druk, Canela, Saol Display, Monument Grotesk and GT America Expanded (1 star) and the detail (mono) role. scripts/typography-fonts.py turns library.files into WOFF2 in fonts/.",
